        "product_summary": "Layered court profile: A rounded closed toe and low collar combine with a broad continuous sole for a casual low-top outline.\n\nWavy quarter overlays: Shaped stitched panels run along the side, with a separate wraparound forefoot overlay.\n\nEyelet lacing and rear loop: Front laces cross the tongue while a short pull loop sits behind the collar.\n\nCircular outsole grooves: The original underside views show concentric sections and surrounding texture; the sole edge has a visible stitch row.\n\nTwo colour directions: White with blue accents and Beige with taupe accents are listed in EU39-44.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
